    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so you're basically saying the humanitarian costs usually outweigh the benefits? if that's the case, isn't it kind of hypocritical for countries to keep using them under the guise of \"human rights\" when they know they just end up hurting the people they're supposed to be helping? seems like the whole \"democratic promotion\" thing is just a cover story at this point.",
